@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR2,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:确实如希罗你所说，<br>我忽略了<br>手机是属于安安的<br>这个事实。|#0203Trial06_Sherry001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR3,ArmL3,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Closed
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:那真相就只有一个了。|#0203Trial06_Sherry002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR3,ArmL12,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Closed01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:凶手就是<br>像希罗刚才说的那样，<br>在犯案前<br>偷走了<br>安安的手机！|#0203Trial06_Sherry003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR17,ArmL12,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:这么一来就没问题了，<br>凶手是可以把手机<br>放到中庭里的！|#0203Trial06_Sherry004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal2,ArmR6,Arms3,Eyes2_Angry_Open1,Mouth2_Determined_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……刚才我也说了，<br>偷手机只会令安安<br>警戒起来，<br>提高实施杀人计划的难度而已。|#0203Trial06_Hiro001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR3,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"但<link=\"Objection_02_03_06_01\">只要她没发现</link><br>就没问题！|#0203Trial06_Sherry005|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR17,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:凶手事先把手机<br>放置在中庭内，<br>再把安安<br>引诱到二楼的<br>阳台去。|#0203Trial06_Sherry006| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

; ＠備考◆「おちてるぅ～↑…なんて言って」みたいな発音イメージ

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"说不定凶手<br>就是跟安安说<br>【那里掉了一部手机！】<br>来<link=\"Objection_02_03_06_02\">诱导</link>她<br>走到阳台上！|#0203Trial06_Sherry007|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR3,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Confused_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:等安安<br>扶着阳台护栏<br>探身往中庭张望的时候，<br>凶手趁机袭击她！|#0203Trial06_Sherry008| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR11,ArmL10,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Flushed_Closed01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:可怜的安安<br>就这样掉了下去，<br>被铁栅<br>刺穿身体而亡！|#0203Trial06_Sherry009| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

; ＠備考◆焦り

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR7,ArmL13,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Surprised_Open02,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Scream_Open,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……可、可是！<br>如果凶手<br>真的做了<br>这一连串的手脚，<br>现场肯定会<br>留下痕迹才对……！？|#0203Trial06_Ema001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR7,ArmL13,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Surprised_Open03,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Scream_Open,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
