@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:你大可放心，<br>艾玛！|#0203Trial06_Sherry010| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"包括脚印在内，<br>跟案件有关的<link=\"Objection_02_03_06_03\">一切痕迹</link><br>都被一场雨冲刷得<br>干干净净了……<br>除了铁栅栏的移位以外！|#0203Trial06_Sherry011|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

; ＠備考◆焦り

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR7,ArmL13,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Surprised_Open02,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Confused_Open,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01
